<title>UK: Blair arrives at Buckingham Palace.</title>
<headline>Blair arrives at Buckingham Palace.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Labour party leader Tony Blair on Friday arrived at Buckingham Palace where Queen Elizabeth will formally invite him to form a new government as prime minister.</p>
